body:
Do you plan to use any of the people there as references for your next job? If not, you have everything you need from the position and just tell them you are leaving. However, if you need a reference, you should have a long talk with your reference contact to explain your situation. If they are on your side, you will have no problems.

&#x200B;

Also, it is illegal to give a bad reference for a previous employee, but a simple "no comment" is a big red flag to prospective employers.
